  "question": {
    "text": "Mass of magnesium required to produce 220 mL of hydrogen gas at STP on reaction with excess of dil. HCl is<br />Given : Molar mass of Mg is $24 \\mathrm{~g} \\mathrm{~mol}^{-1}$.",
