  "solution": {
    "text": "$\\mathrm{Mg}+2 \\mathrm{HCl} \\rightarrow \\mathrm{MgCl}_2+\\mathrm{H}_2$<br />Volume $\\mathrm{H}_2$ evolved $=220 \\mathrm{ml}$<br />Mole of $\\mathrm{H}_2=\\frac{220 \\times 10^{-3}}{22.4}=$ mole of Mg used<br />$\\begin{aligned}<br />\\therefore \\text { Mass of Mg used } & =\\frac{220 \\times 10^{-3}}{22.4} \\times 24 \\\\<br>& =235.7 \\times 10^{-3} \\mathrm{gm} \\\\<br>& =235.7 \\mathrm{mg}<br />\\end{aligned}$",
    "image": null
  },
